config.prompt:
Thesis under test:
{{inputs.thesis}}

The record so far (cite as [n]):
{{nodes.prior.output.items | fenced_sources}}

New evidence:
{{inputs.evidence | default('(none — restate where the thesis stands on the existing record)')}}

Name the pillars the thesis rests on, and the conditions that would INVALIDATE it — a thesis with no invalidators cannot be tracked, because everything confirms it. Then tag each piece of evidence strengthen, weaken, or neutralize, and say plainly whether the thesis is holding. If the evidence undercuts it, say that; a tracker that only ever strengthens its own thesis is a scrapbook.
